<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:style="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:style:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" xmlns:fo="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:xsl-fo-compatible:1.0" office:version="1.3" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text">
<office:styles><style:style style:name="Title" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-bottom="0.3in"/><style:text-properties fo:font-family="Inter" fo:font-size="36pt" fo:color="#0d1215"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Body" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-bottom="0.2in" fo:line-height="140%"/><style:text-properties fo:font-family="Inter" fo:font-size="13pt" fo:color="#0d1215"/></style:style><style:style style:name="Label" style:family="paragraph"><style:paragraph-properties fo:margin-bottom="0.3in"/><style:text-properties fo:font-family="Inter" fo:font-size="10pt" fo:color="#355f3e"/></style:style></office:styles>
<office:body><office:text><text:p text:style-name="Label">LOCAL DOCUMENT FIXTURE / REAL LIBREOFFICE WRITER</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Title">A common material.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">THEARS carries SHEAR beyond the shell: a mineral field, phosphor focus, and the quiet precision of an instrument.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">This local document is an evidence fixture. It contains no account data, live project information, or simulated application controls.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Label">PIYTI / THE NEXT DEGREE OF INTEGRATION</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">A shared visual language prepares the creative workspace for richer context. Deeper app state and commands remain explicit systems requests until implemented.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Body">The page, the toolbar, and the desktop belong to the same working environment. The document stays editable, shortcuts stay familiar, and focus remains clear.</text:p></office:text></office:body>
</office:document>
